mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\nstorytelling-and-narrative is the **narrative-craft layer** — find the real story, structure the arc, anchor\nit in specifics, land the meaning, and shape it to the format. It **feeds the format writers**; **WoopSocial\npublishes**; serialized arcs map into the **content-calendar.**\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** finds the **real story**, structures the **arc** (setup → turning point → payoff; audience as\n  hero, brand as guide), **anchors specifics**, **tunes the emotion/meaning**, and **shapes it to the format.**\n- It **routes** format mechanics to the **format writers** (`reels-script`, `carousel-writer`,\n  `linkedin-post-writer`, `thread-writer`, `caption-writer`), the opening to `hook-writer`, and the visual to\n  the **image tools**/`design-and-templates`. **WoopSocial publishes**; **serialized arcs map into the\n  `content-calendar`.**\n- **Never fabricate a story or testimonial** (truth + consent — real ones → `social-proof-and-testimonials`/\n  `ugc-and-influencer`). **Authenticity over polish.** **Not every post needs a story** (forcing it =\n  melodrama). **Story metrics = saves/shares/comments/profile visits, not likes.** **Never guarantee\n  virality.** **Verify-quarterly** (platform framing + cited stats).\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **storytelling-and-narrative (this)** — the **narrative CRAFT/structure** across **all** formats.\n- **story-writer** — the **IG/FB Stories FORMAT** (ephemeral frame sequences). *Different sense of \"story.\"*\n- **hook-writer** — the **opening line / scroll-stopper** (the **entry** to the arc — **they pair**).\n- **caption-writer / carousel-writer / thread-writer / linkedin-post-writer / reels-script / tiktok-script** —\n  the **format mechanics** (this provides the **structure** that goes into them — it **feeds** them).\n- **brand-profile / voice-builder** — the **voice/identity** (this reads them; keeps narrative voice\n  consistent).\n- **content-pillars / social-strategy** — the **topic strategy** (this is **how** to tell a topic as a story).\n- **social-proof-and-testimonials** — the **testimonial/case-study content** (this is the **narrative craft**\n  applied to them).\n- **campaign-and-launch-planning** — the **launch arc across posts** (serialized storytelling **feeds** it).\n- **viral-reverse-engineering** — **deconstructs** virality (this **builds** narrative).\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` + `voice-builder` (voice/identity + real proof points).\n- **Feeds:** the **format writers** (the arc → the post/Reel/carousel/thread), `hook-writer` (the open),\n  `content-calendar` (serialized arcs), `image-prompt`/`design-and-templates` (the visual of the beat).\n- **Pulls true material from:** `social-proof-and-testimonials`, `ugc-and-influencer`,\n  `behind-the-scenes-and-founder`, `audience-research`.\n- **Publishes via:** the format writer's output → `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial`. **Measure with:** native\n  + `analytics-and-reporting` on **saves/shares/comments/profile visits** (never fabricated).\n"
